& [SpecificationIdentity] is pure implementation authority
  + [specification_uuid] is 6621ce4a-d4ba-4323-a08e-e6d22b00a416
  + [profile] is cantor-windows-entry-policy/0.1
  + [source_snapshot_uuid] is 3ffdebee-15aa-4ef6-ae4d-ad80b5912ce0
  + [target_module] is crates/cantor_ecosystem/src/windows_entry_policy.rs

& [InputContract] is strict
  + [kind] is directory or regular_file
  + [attributes] is an exact u32
  + [directory_case_sensitive_flags] is required and zero for directory, absent for regular_file
  + [component] is exact nonempty Unicode
  + [maximum_component_utf16_units] is 1 through 32767
  = must: reject unknown JSON fields and unknown enum variants

& [AttributeContract] is exhaustive
  + [benign_mask] is 0x00002027
  + [directory_bit] is 0x00000010
  + [directory_allowed_mask] is 0x00002037
  + [normal] is 0x00000080
  + [directory] requires DIRECTORY and permits only the directory allowed mask
  + [regular_normal] is exactly NORMAL
  + [regular_marked] is a nonzero subset of benign mask
  + [everything_else] rejects as attribute fault

& [ComponentContract] is exact
  + [UTF16_units] are nonzero and do not exceed the supplied bound
  + [forbidden_scalars] are NUL, U+0001 through U+001F, <, >, :, quote, slash, backslash, vertical-bar, question-mark, and asterisk
  + [terminal] space and period reject
  + [navigation] dot and dot-dot reject
  + [Git_control] .git rejects by ASCII case-insensitive equality
  + [reserved_fixed] CON, PRN, AUX, and NUL reject before first period
  + [reserved_numbered] COM1 through COM9 and LPT1 through LPT9 reject before first period
  + [reserved_superscript] COM or LPT followed by superscript 1, 2, or 3 reject before first period
  + [Unicode] is preserved without normalization

& [OutputContract] is inspectable
  + [decision] preserves exact input fields
  + [order_key_hex] is canonical lowercase hex of exact component UTF-8 bytes
  + [fault] exposes one closed code, field, and bounded reason
  - never: output an OS, path, handle, Git, stream, receipt, or physical fact

& [ImplementationBoundary] is zero effect
  + [Cargo_delta] is zero
  + [unsafe] is denied
  + [production_module] may import only std, serde, and this crate's pure forms
  - never: use windows-sys, filesystem, process, environment, clock, random, network, model, or persistence APIs

& [Requirements] are M2B-WEP-001 through M2B-WEP-012
  + [M2B-WEP-001] strict profile and JSON
  + [M2B-WEP-002] exact attribute constants
  + [M2B-WEP-003] exhaustive directory attributes
  + [M2B-WEP-004] exhaustive regular attributes
  + [M2B-WEP-005] exact case-field relation
  + [M2B-WEP-006] UTF-16 resource bound
  + [M2B-WEP-007] character and terminal rejection
  + [M2B-WEP-008] navigation and Git rejection
  + [M2B-WEP-009] reserved-device rejection
  + [M2B-WEP-010] exact Unicode preservation and UTF-8 order key
  + [M2B-WEP-011] pure no-effect static proof
  + [M2B-WEP-012] verification, evidence, rollback, and nonclaims

& [SatisfactionSignature] is valid for pure implementation
  + [signature_protocol_uuid] is 5b397e2d-8197-4480-be5f-ca6f2c6156fd
  + [signature_uuid] is 554e84a7-988c-4c86-b67d-45958ab7166c
  + [status] is valid
  + [implementation_authority] is one pure module, one export, tests, and governed proof records
  + [execution_authority] is pure in-memory test execution only
  + [invalidation] is any Win32 call, filesystem observation, unsafe, dependency delta, profile change, admitted reserved name, broadened attribute mask, normalization, or scanner claim
